 ## Current (2026-10-09)
 
+- Rehearsal's owner-approved first build is running in `f0d3` on loopback port
+  3010. One persistent canvas has 176 cached real-screen nodes arranged as a horizontal
+  application timeline, branch lanes and declared action arrows, with a bounded
+  camera and an expanding screen navigator. Flow selection fits the whole flow;
+  screen selection focuses it and panning updates the viewed-screen highlight.
+  A live screen in that canvas runs the real towel intake through both ownership paths, retains raw
+  fields across confirmed transitions, and persists reversible heading/action/color
+  proposals that can be played. Inspect and Review share the optional right pane.
+  Reviews filter by screen, flow and status, retain their frozen screenshot and
+  inputs while navigating, and resolve with evidence. Focusing a review preserves
+  the run. Exact historical replay, automatic before/after and full multiplayer are open.
+  The latest owner-requested tldraw/Figma/Paper controls pass adds a compact shell,
+  collapsible outline, floating Select/Hand, zoom/fit menu and guarded shortcuts.
+  Claude Design and local Open Design supplied completed text critiques.
+  Types/styles, 59 focused tests and four API/inventory checks pass. Browser
+  evidence includes phone and desktop consolidation, retained inputs, frozen
+  reviews and proposal v6 play; earlier tablet and failed-save receipts remain historical.
+  Play on another flow retains unpublished towel edits. Review staleness is
+  recomputed against the current source when retrieved.
+  [Build evidence and limits](../design/review-product/build-evidence.md),
+  [dogfood observations](../design/review-product/workspace-observations.md).
+  This uncommitted local delivery does not attest native/device acceptance,
+  complete app journey coverage or adoption of proposals into the application.
+
+- A connected review workspace is implemented locally in isolated checkout `f0d3`,
+  based on `0bffbbcf`. It provides 34 working synthetic states, a searchable
+  scenario/persona navigator, direct links and explicit restart, real intake and
+  saved-record editors, durable annotated feedback and an authenticated agent API.
+  The connected index links component/design/check sources, revisions and separate
+  missing/stale coverage. Local verification is recorded in the input-bound
+  [receipt](../design/review-validation.json); [access, operation and boundaries](../design/connected-review-workspace.md)
+  are documented. Canonical review-shell reconciliation, physical-device/phone
+  deployment, native runners and simultaneous collaboration remain open. Its
+  original canvas gap is superseded by the Rehearsal entry above.
+  This is an uncommitted local delivery, not released application behavior or an
